            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SQUEEZIECAKE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious!\nIt makes a TON, however! I cut the recipe in half for our 9 adult Thanksgiving dinner and there was still a little left over. Also - cut down a bit on the dressing. I think if using the amount listed it will be really too much. Thanks for the recipe!!!",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-01T10:48:09.340Z"
